    <string name="notify_gm_title">Turn off Google Messages\' notifications</string>
    <string name="notify_gm_note">PingMe notifies you of every text, so Google Messages should not: otherwise each one arrives twice. In the phone\'s Settings, open Apps, then Messages, then Notifications, and turn them off. PingMe does not change another app\'s settings.</string>
